# Google OAuth – used by /auth/google to verify the id_token the frontend
# (NextAuth GoogleProvider) forwards from the browser.
# Create credentials at https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials :
#   - Application type: Web application
#   - Authorized JavaScript origins: http://localhost:3000, https://compsci.president.ac.id
#   - Authorized redirect URIs: http://localhost:3000/api/auth/callback/google
#                               https://compsci.president.ac.id/api/auth/callback/google
# The backend only needs the CLIENT_ID (audience check); the CLIENT_SECRET
# lives on the frontend.
GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=